{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35701","headline":"长歌行 · 李咸用","name":"长歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"要衣须破束，欲炙须解牛。\n当年不快意，徒爲他人留。\n百岁之约何悠悠，华髪星星稀满头。\n蛾眉螓首聊我仇，圆红阙白令人愁，何不夕引清奏？\n朝登翠楼，逢花便折，闻胜即游。\n鼓腕腾棍晴雷收，舞腰困褭垂杨柔。\n象筯击折歌勿休，玉山未倒非风流。\n眼前有物俱是梦，莫将身作黄金讐。\n死生同域不用惧，富贵在天何足忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}